<parameterdescription>
<para>A callable with signature <computeroutput>double operator()(IdxBatch, Coord&lt;Dim1, Dim2&gt;)</computeroutput> returning <formula id="159">$ \alpha $</formula> at the given batch and coordinate. </para>
